	(text_box "LEDs are LTST-S110TGKT, which means they draw at most 20mA. There are 8 LEDs per shift register (SN74HC595N), which can only handle 70 mA across all pins. Thus the resistors are 330 ohm, which makes the LEDs draw around 5.5 mA."
